WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.302
-You know, we don't always
have enough time

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.372
to cover everything
in the recent news,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.773
so, here with a recap is one
of our writers, Amber Ruffin,

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:10.042
with a segment we call
"Amber Says What"!

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:13.546
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.648
-You guys!
The last couple months

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.316
have been crazy!

00:00:17.316 --> 00:00:19.885
Okay, so, first of all,
Donald Trump went

00:00:19.885 --> 00:00:22.688
to the World Series
and got booed!

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.256
And I was like, "What?!"

00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:27.059
[ Laughter ]
Then, he went to a UFC fight

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:30.896
and also got booed and I was
like, [laughing] "What?!"

00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:33.232
[ Laughter ]
Then, during his book tour,

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:35.635
Donald Trump Jr. got
booed offstage

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.937
and I was like,
[laughing] "What?!"

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.738
[ Laughter ]
I didn't know gettin' booed

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:40.973
was hereditary.

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.342
[ Laughter ]
So, then, everyone was like,

00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:45.744
"Have you seen Cinder-Block?"
And I was like, "What?

00:00:45.744 --> 00:00:47.247
I don't watch wrestling."

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:48.414
Then, they were like,
"It's a cat."

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.715
And I was like, "What?!

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:51.284
Why would you name a cat
Cinder-Block?"

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:54.320
And they showed me a picture
and I was like, "What?!"

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.388
[ Laughter, awws ]

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.757
That is a cinder block
with whiskers.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.359
[ Laughter ]
So, apparently,

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.527
this cat has gained
too much weight

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:04.496
and has to walk
on a treadmill in a puddle!

00:01:04.496 --> 00:01:06.366
[ Awwing ]
I was like, "What?!"

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:08.468
[ Laughter ]
Look, if it gets to the point

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.002
where you have to put me
in a harness

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:12.238
and make me walk
on a treadmill in a puddle

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.841
as I beg you to stop,
let me die.

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:16.041
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.041 --> 00:01:17.843
Then, I read that a French lady

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.380
gave birth to a baby
at a nightclub

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.581
and I was like,<i> "Quoi?!"</i>
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:25.585
<i> Vous ne devriez pas accoucher
 dans un club!</i>

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.854
[ Laughter ]
But, then, I read that the baby

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:31.190
would have free entry for life
and I was like, "What?!

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.626
Quelle bébé cool!"

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.295
[ Laughter ]
Then, the man who wrote

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:37.296
the movie "Harriet,"
about Harriet Tubman,

00:01:37.296 --> 00:01:39.865
said that a studio
executive once suggested

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:42.568
that Julia Roberts play her
and people were like,

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.670
"Wha-a-a-t?!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.205
But I was like, "What?

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:48.274
Everyone should play
whoever they want."

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.376
That's why you can catch me
in "Y'all Want This Flag?

00:01:51.376 --> 00:01:52.711
The Betsy Ross Story."

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.446
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:57.683
Then, there was a rally called
Black Voices for Trump --

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:00.887
I'm sorry. Can you not have
that like right by my head?

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.422
Lower. Lower. Even farther.

00:02:03.422 --> 00:02:05.457
[ Laughter ]
Oh, bless your heart.

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:09.028
Now, there was a rally called
Black Voices for Trump

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:11.297
and I was like, "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:13.566
If you think your
Trump-supporting relatives

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:17.436
are embarrassing, imagine
how embarrassed you would be

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:18.804
if they were Black.

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:20.173
[ Laughter ]
Now, I wouldn't know,

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:23.009
'cause I don't have any Trump
supporters in my family

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.644
dumb enough to say something.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.912
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:31.383
So, then, former quarterback
Colin Kaepernick

00:02:31.383 --> 00:02:33.385
got invited to train
in front of coaches

00:02:33.385 --> 00:02:36.222
to see if they wanna sign him
and I was like, "What?!...

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.424
do you need to see him
work out for?"

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.726
You know damn well that,
even if he did nothing

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:43.863
but eat cheeseburgers and play
Xbox for the past three years,

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.298
he's still better
than Daniel Jones.

00:02:46.298 --> 00:02:48.534
[ Laughter, oohs ]
And that's something I overhead

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:51.037
one of our security guards say.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:52.905
The only thing I know
about football is that

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:54.306
it gives you dementia.

00:02:54.306 --> 00:02:56.442
[ Ding! ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.111
Then, White House
Advisor Stephen Miller --

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:00.513
you know,
the guy who's in charge

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.548
of all the terrible stuff
happening at the border? --

00:03:02.548 --> 00:03:04.517
had a bunch of his emails leaked

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.552
and they were full
of racist stuff

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:08.888
and people were like,
"Wha-a-a-t?!

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:11.624
[ Laughter ]
I think this guy is a racist!"

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:13.826
And I was like, "What?!"

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.161
A teachable moment.

00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:18.164
So, stick with me here.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.164 --> 00:03:20.365
[slowly] The White House

00:03:20.365 --> 00:03:22.835
hired Stephen Mil-ler

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:26.439
to be in charge of what's
happening at the bor-der.

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:29.074
Now, what's happening
at the bor-der

00:03:29.074 --> 00:03:31.778
is rac-ist.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.778 --> 00:03:35.615
That means that
Stephen Miller is rac-ist.

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:40.719
So, if you are okay with what's
happening at the bor-der,

00:03:40.719 --> 00:03:42.955
even after reading
Miller's emails,

00:03:42.955 --> 00:03:47.126
then you are a rac-ist.

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:49.195
[ Laughter and applause ]
And that's a lesson you can take

00:03:49.195 --> 00:03:51.664
to Thanksgiving dinner.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.732
[ Applause ]

00:03:53.732 --> 00:03:58.604
Your racist uncle's gonna be
like, "Wha-a-a-a-a-t?!"

00:03:58.604 --> 00:04:03.209
[ Cheering and applause ]
So, back to one.

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:05.311
So, remember last year,
when they came out

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.746
with the trailer
for "Sonic the Hedgehog" movie

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:10.149
and, when everyone saw
the creepy new version of Sonic,

00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:12.118
they were like, "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:13.652
[ Laughter ]
Well, they went back

00:04:13.652 --> 00:04:16.322
and changed him and I saw
the new Sonic and I was like,

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:18.524
"Wha-a-t?!"
He looks great!

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:21.160
I don't even remember what
the old one looks like anymore.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.394
Aah!
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.394 --> 00:04:23.563
I'm just kidding.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:25.698
It lives on in my nightmares.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:28.801
Then, they put up a tree
at Rockefeller Center

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:31.003
and I was like,
[singsong] "Wha-a-a-t?!"

00:04:31.003 --> 00:04:33.239
Then, they put a star
on top of the tree.

00:04:33.239 --> 00:04:34.540
Do you know how I know?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.843
Because I saw it from my
office window. Look!

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:39.745
Look, it's the
Christmas tree star.

00:04:39.745 --> 00:04:41.981
♪ Whoa-oa ♪

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:43.950
♪ It's gonna take a while ♪

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.051
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:46.585
♪ Step into Christmas ♪

00:04:46.585 --> 00:04:48.153
♪ Amber Mildred Ruffin ♪

00:04:48.153 --> 00:04:49.788
♪ Made this stuff
for Christmas ♪

00:04:49.788 --> 00:04:51.657
♪ So quickety biscuits ♪

00:04:51.657 --> 00:04:53.259
♪ Yay-ay-ay-ay-ay ♪

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.660
That's Christmas.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.361
[ Laughter and applause ]
Yay!

00:04:56.361 --> 00:04:58.631
It's Christmas!

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.032
Christmas is now.

00:05:00.032 --> 00:05:02.467
Then, I was like, "What?!
do I have to do

00:05:02.467 --> 00:05:05.171
to get to go up there
and get right up next to it?"

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:08.741
So, I asked, and they let me.
Look!

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:11.677
[ Laughter ]
This has been "Amber Says What"!

00:05:11.677 --> 00:05:13.011
[ Cheering ]

00:05:13.011 --> 00:05:14.780
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.050
♪♪
[ Whistling ]

